{"arrivo":"fi","origine":"ine-bsl-pro","origine_nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","n":4,"n_alternative":4,"parole":[{"parola":"harakka","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"Possibly; alternatively","significato":"magpie (bird of the genus Pica)","termine_origine":"*śárˀkāˀ","catena":[{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*śárˀkāˀ","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-bsl-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","alternative":[{"codice":"urj-fin-pro","nome":"Proto-Finnic","termine":"*harakka","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*śárˀkāˀ","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"testo":"From Proto-Finnic *harakka ~ *haraga, possibly of onomatopoeic origin, or alternatively borrowed from Proto-Balto-Slavic *śárˀkāˀ."},{"parola":"hirvas","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"either","significato":"reindeer stag (adult male reindeer, sometimes defined as one that is at least three years old)","termine_origine":"*śirwas","catena":[{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*śirwas","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-bsl-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","alternative":[{"codice":"urj-fin-pro","nome":"Proto-Finnic","termine":"*hirvas","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*śirwas","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"testo":"From Proto-Finnic *hirvas, borrowed from Proto-Balto-Slavic *śirwas. Cognate with Northern Sami sarvvis, which must have either been borrowed directly from Balto-Slavic or (more likely) come via Finnic before *š became h. Doublet of sarvas."},{"parola":"järvi","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"Probably; or from; either","significato":"lake (large, landlocked stretch of water)","termine_origine":"*jáuˀrāˀ","catena":[{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*jáuˀrāˀ","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-bsl-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","alternative":[{"codice":"urj-fin-pro","nome":"Proto-Finnic","termine":"*järvi","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"urj-fpr-pro","nome":"Proto-Finno-Permic","termine":"*jäwrä","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*jáuˀrāˀ","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*yewHr-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"testo":"From Proto-Finnic *järvi (compare Estonian järv), from Proto-Finno-Permic *jäwrä (compare Northern Sami jávri, Erzya эрьке (eŕke)), probably borrowed from Indo-European, either from Proto-Balto-Slavic *jáuˀrāˀ (compare Lithuanian jáura (“marshland, bog”)) or from earlier Proto-Indo-European *yewHr-."},{"parola":"metu","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"alternatively; either","significato":"mead","termine_origine":"*medú","catena":[{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*medú","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-bsl-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","alternative":[{"codice":"urj-fin-pro","nome":"Proto-Finnic","termine":"*mëtu","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*medú","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*meduz","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"testo":"From Proto-Finnic *mëtu, borrowed either from Proto-Balto-Slavic *medú or alternatively Proto-Germanic *meduz. Cognate with Estonian mõdu, Võro mõdu and Votic mõtu."}]}